  "doubles": [
    "Full pinned PageEntityService/pages-show/DriveFileEntityService/IdService modules and their imported pure helpers are transpiled and required from pinned Git objects; no method-body extraction.",
    "Nest decorators and Endpoint lifecycle are inert adapters; endpoint handler and schema remain source code.",
    "Repository doubles apply fixed PostgreSQL null/undefined WHERE-ignore semantics, exact remaining filters, explicit missing/failure states and asynchronous content update; real PostgreSQL and normal HTTP tested separately.",
    "UserEntityService.pack double emits only id/username, records default UserLite option and viewer; real UserLite fields are asserted in HTTP tests.",
    "DriveFolder/Utility/Video services are unused for these image fixtures; ID generation randomness uses zeroes for module initialization; generation is outside these cases."
  ],
